WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:21.770
Jonouchi fell in his Shadow Game against Marik.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:24.220
Please don't die!

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:27.600
If I lose you...

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:32.900
The Millennium Necklace that Ishizu gave me showed me a vision of the future.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.510
I will believe in that future and fight!

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:42.980
In order to fulfill my promise with Jonouchi and achieve that future!

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:48.990
Coliseum in the Sky
Yugi vs Kaiba

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.640
Mr. Seto, it's almost time for the second match.

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.640
He'll show.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:14.640
He'll never run from a duel against me.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.550
This is our duel of destiny!

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:27.090
Partner, our fight awaits.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.400
Yeah.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:40.200
There you are, Yugi.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.080
Kaiba.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.750
It's finally time to end this.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:59.240
Seems your noisy fan club isn't here.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.400
Was Jonouchi's coffin too heavy to carry?

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.800
Jonouchi is still fighting!

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.430
That's what I believe!

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:10.430
I don't care what you believe.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:15.680
But he fought a tougher duel against Marik than expected.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:18.050
He even forced him to play a God.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:23.380
As a duelist, he should feel satisfied and have no regrets.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.000
Kaiba...

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:31.740
We fought in Battle City to learn what lies ahead in our road of battle.

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:35.560
Jonouchi and I haven't found that answer yet.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.580
There's no answer for a loser.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.500
Only humiliation and despair.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:41.710
You're wrong!

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:44.340
Do you give up after losing?

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:47.940
Or do you stand up and look to the future?

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:51.440
Do you walk the road of battle that lasts forever?

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:54.450
An answer always lies ahead!

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:58.700
What is a true duelist?

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:03.090
Jonouchi is still fighting to find the answer!

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.650
Lame.

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:07.500
There can be only one true winner!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:15.100
The duelist who defeats everyone and grabs the glory gains everything!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:19.500
And is the one chosen by the three God Cards!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:24.940
Yugi, I will defeat you and become the Duel King!

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.460
Hey!  I think his hand moved!

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.390
Brother?

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:43.390
No.  He's still unconscious.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:44.830
Jonouchi...

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.830
Damn!  Isn't the helicopter here yet?

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.600
I'm going to ask Mokuba!

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:57.370
Jonouchi, Yugi's duel is about to start.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.680
Jonouchi...

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:04.120
I'm going to meet Kaiba at the Duel Ring.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.500
Yugi...

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:12.850
So Jonouchi, you keep fighting as a duelist!

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:18.910
Why must you keep fighting despite everything that's happened?

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:21.020
I don't understand!

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.570
You just have to trust him.

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:25.320
Ishizu.

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:29.340
We have the light of hope that repels the darkness.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:30.820
Let's trust that.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.380
Yugi...

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.580
Our promise...

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:42.250
We haven't become true duelists yet.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:48.720
I was worried this duel would be boring because Jonouchi's defeat broke your spirit.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.050
But I didn't need to.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:52.430
Your fighting spirit is still strong.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:06:00.500
Semifinal #2 between Seto Kaiba and Yugi Muto will now begin!

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:03.610
Let's do this, Yugi!

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.140
My Obelisk...

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.270
Or your Slifer!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.650
The gods will now clash!

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:21.260
The winner of this duel will have two God Cards.

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.820
That's what we ante with our pride!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:32.370
This duel field is too boring for something as grand as determining the best duelist.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:37.800
I've prepared a suitable stage for our duel of destiny.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.810
Activating Sold Vision System!

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:54.340
What's this?

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:59.220
In the battle for the Duel King title, the setting will be...

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.470
The Sky Coliseum!

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:10.070
Kaiba!  Kaiba!  Kaiba!

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:16.910
Yugi, fate has led us here to determine a winner and loser!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:22.620
We will fight like Roman gladiators who risked their lives for pride and freedom!

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:25.790
Draw a card from your deck, like a sword!

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.190
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.820
If my card is my sword, my Duel Disk is my shield.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:35.430
My pride is in my right hand's card!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.570
And my soul is in my left arm's Duel Disk!

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:40.640
Here I go, Kaiba!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.810
Bring it, Yugi!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.400
My card is...

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:49.000
Queen's Knight in defense position!

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:52.850
I set a card!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.280
I end my turn.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:56.950
My turn!

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.080
I draw!

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:03.360
The goddess of victory always smiles upon me.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:07.230
All that's left to do is gather three tributes on my field.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:11.670
What strategy will Kaiba use in this duel?

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:18.470
Will he destroy my deck and hurt me with powerful monsters, like he did against Ishizu?

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:20.280
My turn!

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.060
Vorse Raider attacks!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:25.440
Destroy Keldo!

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:30.290
I flip over my set cards!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.420
Fall into my death trap!

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:44.470
My virus infects my Dark Attribute monster with 1000 or fewer attack points.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:47.700
Destroying your monster and deck!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:54.400
But I have full knowledge of his deck destruction strategy.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:59.050
So his deck definitely has a new strategy.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:02.850
I summon X-Head Cannon in attack position!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.960
I also activate a spell card!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.390
Spell Sanctuary!

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:13.330
Spell Sanctuary?

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:18.600
This card adds one spell card in our decks to our hands.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:24.270
And its Continuous Spell effect allows me to use spell cards on your turn.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.710
Draw whatever card you like!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:34.680
Kaiba is willing to risk letting me choose a card.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:38.120
Which spell card did he get?

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.960
I set a card!

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:43.890
I end my turn!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.450
You'll lose next turn.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:50.430
I already have the combo cards to defeat you.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:53.870
Mokuba!  Where's the helicopter!

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:55.600
I can't reach them.

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:57.940
There's radio interference.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:59.870
What?  No way!

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.560
Can you hear me!

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:03.580
Answer me!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.750
We have a patient here!

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:10.510
Brother...

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.420
Brother!

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.720
Did someone call me?

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.500
Huh?  What was I doing again?

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.600
This deck...

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:28.540
Oh yeah!

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:32.070
I'm in the city's duel tournament.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.400
Next is the second round!

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:37.650
Watch me!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.410
I'm going to win!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:53.160
Kaiba and Yugi.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.230
A clash between two Gods.

00:10:56.480 --> 00:11:00.470
I have to watch this duel with my own eyes.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:26.890
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:33.500
Kaiba's monster has more attack points than my monster's defense points.

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.170
But he didn't attack.

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:39.340
Is he worried about my set card?

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:40.660
Or...

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.320
I summon another monster!

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:47.680
Alpha The Magnet Warrior in defense position!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:51.820
I also set one card!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.450
I end my turn.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:12:01.230
You'll learn how foolish and dangerous it is to place low-class monsters in front of me.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.660
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:08.770
Yugi, kneel before my God and perish!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.280
I activate a spell card from my hand this turn!

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:13.710
Soul Exchange!

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:15.640
Soul Exchange!

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:26.290
Due to Soul Exchange, your two monsters become my servants!

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.220
And I can tribute them!

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:34.330
Along with X-Head Cannon, I tribute three monsters-

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:36.440
I don't think so, Kaiba!

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.650
I flip over my set card!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:39.970
Change of Heart!

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:40.800
What?

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:49.700
I'm also allowed to use your Spell Sanctuary's effect to activate a spell during your turn!

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:57.380
X-Head Cannon is my servant for one turn.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:00.820
Kaiba, I won't let you summon a God!

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:04.970
So you knew my plan.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.760
I'd congratulate you, but that wasn't good enough!

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.340
I flip over my set card!

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:11.980
Enemy Controller!

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:14.800
What?

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:20.970
By entering a code, this card lets me control your monster!

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:22.660
I pay 1000 life points!

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:24.780
Left!  Right!  A!  B!

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:34.720
This code allows me to tribute X-Head Cannon.

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:40.040
I now have three tributes!

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:47.600
Kaiba is summoning Obelisk in only two turns?

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:48.840
Come here!

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:52.480
Obelisk!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.400
I won't let you!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:56.780
Lightforce Sword!

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:09.220
Lightforce Sword seals your God Card for three turns.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:10.510
Don't be so impatient.

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:13.160
The game just started, Kaiba.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:21.330
You may have avoided a quick defeat, but you're still going to lose!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.940
Honda hasn't returned yet?

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:30.570
What's he doing?

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:31.680
Yugi...

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:37.140
It's too quiet.

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:39.250
Like the calm before the storm.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.400
A battle between duelists with God Cards.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.630
It will be the fiercest duel ever.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.000
What will happen when they clash?

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:01.000
Since Obelisk's summoning was negated...

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:06.310
...the three tributes remain on the field, and Soul Exchange's effect is gone!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:18.860
My sealed God Card won't return to my hand until three turns have passed.

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:24.230
But I already have another way to summon a God.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.280
I end my turn.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.530
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.970
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:35.340
I have two monsters on my field.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:40.430
If I get one more, I'll have three tributes needed to summon my God.

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:44.280
But Slifer is still in my deck.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:49.660
Kaiba's X-Head Cannon has 1800 attack points.

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:52.690
The monsters on my field can't destroy it.

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:56.360
No monster in my hand is strong enough either.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.800
I need to survive for now.

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.970
I set a card!

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:06.410
I keep my monsters in defense and end my turn!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:11.580
If you play scared, three turns will pass in the blink of an eye, Yugi!

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:18.420
But I don't need three turns for God to finish you.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.920
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.390
How's the duel going?

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:33.560
Ooh!  Kaiba's Obelisk is skewered.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:36.840
But Yugi can't attack.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:40.640
Who will summon a God first?

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.840
Who will win this duel?

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:47.530
And have the misfortune of being buried in the darkness by me?

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:53.100
Either way, I'll be the one who kills Yugi.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.600
My card is...

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:00.260
I summon Y-Dragon Head in attack position!

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:05.830
Y-Dragon Head...

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:09.660
Kaiba's other monster is X-Head Cannon.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.960
X and Y...

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:15.840
No way!  They're magnet monsters that can combine!

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:17.150
Exactly.

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:18.840
X, Y and Z.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:24.580
When at least two are summoned, their combining effect activates!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.200
Combine!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.650
XY-Dragon Cannon!

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:38.400
If I summon Z, their combination will be complete.

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:43.940
By combining the three magnet monsters, its attack and defense points power up.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:47.370
He'll destroy my monsters with overwhelming power.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:49.680
When the card's seal ends...

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:54.060
...he will tribute his magnet monsters to summon Obelisk.

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:57.130
That's Kaiba's goal.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:00.790
It's a perfect strategy to summon his God.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.790
XY-Dragon Cannon attacks!

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.590
Hyper Destruction!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:13.100
Vanish, you weak monster!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:23.280
When my monster is in defense position, I don't lose life points when it's destroyed.

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:27.130
But Obelisk has 4000 attack points.

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:30.580
If he summons it, a single strike will drop my life points to 0.

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:36.320
You're scared of my God that you've sealed away, Yugi?

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:40.890
But what if I don't have to wait for three turns?

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:41.960
What?

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:46.260
A God always comes to the strongest duelist.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:51.430
He's right.  I agree.

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.870
But you're not the strongest, Kaiba.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.060
I activate my spell card!

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:57.410
Lullaby of Obedience!

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:05.650
With this spell card, a Level 8 or higher monster in your deck becomes my servant...

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:07.790
...by calling out its name.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.540
Yes.  The God's name.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.300
Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.630
Hand over the God in your deck.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.480
It was pretty deep in your deck.

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:44.350
You never would've drawn this God during this duel.

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:49.160
Kaiba now has two God Cards.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:52.340
Do you understand now, Yugi?

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:55.700
All Gods only obey me!

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.320
Are you sure?

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:01.640
You and I had the same idea.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:02.970
What?

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:09.910
When Obelisk's seal wore off, I was going to activate that set card.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.850
I flip over my set card!

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.420
Exchange!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:17.220
Exchange?  That spell card swaps cards in our hands!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:23.660
This special card restored my friendship with Jonouchi before.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:33.470
Jonouchi, you can choose and take one of these four cards.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:46.480
Dammit!

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:52.290
Jonouchi!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:59.780
That's when we inherited Jonouchi's soul as a duelist.

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:04.240
And we're still fighting alongside Jonouchi's soul!

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:08.350
Kaiba!  Give Slifer back!

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.610
We will win!

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:16.250
Now you pick.

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:25.090
Thanks, Kaiba.

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:29.260
God is now in my hand!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.800
Yugi used Lightforce Sword to seal Obelisk away.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:51.780
He also used Exchange to get Slifer into his hand.

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:56.040
But he needs three tributes on his field to summon his God.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:22:01.480
Kaiba now has three monsters on his field - X, Y and Z!

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:06.640
Can Yugi summon Slifer before Lightforce Sword's effect ends?

00:22:06.640 --> 00:22:09.140
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Three Knights Who Summon God

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:10.660
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:21.290
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.290 --> 00:22:30.230
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:35.210
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:39.180
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.610 --> 00:22:47.150
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:50.720
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:55.490
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.490 --> 00:23:05.600
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:13.210
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:22.180
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.180 --> 00:23:30.160
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:40.000
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
